captured
route: GET /pods/<pod>/records/<set>
status: 200
tack-sends: no
note: another task wrote a row with the same ref and has its own: a task-scoped set does not share
command: curl -X GET http://127.0.0.1:<port>/pods/saas-notes/records/tack_proposals?task=task-capture-b&limit=50 (bearer token from docket's --token-file)
docket: docket 0.3.0b1 (API 6), source checkout cdeabac3
env: HOME and DOCKET_HOME (a throwaway folder), PATH, HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY/ALL_PROXY (an unreachable loopback port); no model, no provider key
date: 2026-10-31
redacted: the scratch folder (as /scratch), timestamps (as 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z), 40-hex commit ids (as zeros), task ids (as an all-zero uuid), escalation ids (as esc-000000000000), approval and sweep-run ids (as an all-zero uuid), claimPid
